/* GC-barriered pointer atomic slot operations for SRFI-230 and work-stealing.
 * Uses atomic_exchange so concurrent writers SATB-shade the exact overwritten
 * value without a load-then-store race, and marks the generational card before
 * publishing any heap-allocated referent. */
